Tools: Ansible, Chef, Puppet

Use: Automates infrastructure setup, provisioning, and application deployment.
Why These Tools?
Before configuration management tools, sysadmins manually configured servers, leading to inconsistencies.
Puppet/Chef: Introduced Infrastructure as Code (IaC) and centralized configurations.
Ansible improved by:
Eliminating the need for a master node.
Using SSH for communication, making it lightweight and easy to use.
Drawbacks of Manual Configuration:
Error-prone, time-consuming, and inconsistent.
